  "description": "Provides a json formatter for use with Microsoft.Extensions.Logging that is similar to JsonConsoleFormatter except that state and scope keys are flattened into properties on a single json object instead of written as nested object. This results in a simpler json formatted log message that is just a list of key-value pairs.",
